# composite.py rewrites every candidate into the whole 1200x2670 drawer screenshot and crops a
# two-row strip out of it, which is ~4.6 MB of PNG that regenerates in one command. Only the
# contact sheet is kept, because that is the one image somebody opens without running anything.
# Everything the gallery needs is already inside gallery.html as data URIs.
*-drawer.png
*-crop.png
